# BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile (same as Dockerfile.dockerignore): without this the
# nightly, whose checkout already ran pnpm install, copied node_modules in and `pnpm install` waited for a Y/n answer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/src/generated
.git
.github
docs
deploy/helm
**/screenshots
